image is-top_left"/></div></div></div><div class="product_scroll_card second_card"><div class="product_stack_card u-radius-small u-overflow-clip u-zindex-2"><div class="card is-white padding-sm u-radius-none u-vflex-stretch-top"><div class="image_wrap u-vflex-left-top"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/698261c3574d39588ea43d14_TonicStructural-Horizontal-Dark-homepage.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-1-5rem"/></div><div data-padding-top="x-small" class="content_wrap"><h3 class="u-text-style-h3">Sanitize production data for testing</h3><p class="inline_size_small_p">Accelerate your release cycles and eliminate critical bugs in production by fueling staging and QA environments with high-fidelity test data that mirrors the complexity of production.</p></div><div data-padding-bottom="1.5" data-padding-top="1.5" class="button_wrap u-hflex-left-center u-gap-gutter u-hflex-wrap"><div data-padding-top="" class="button-primary-wrapper"><a data-wf-native-id-path="278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96a:278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb979:481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223054:481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223051" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223051" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96a%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c3da83e4-b293-2fc5-e0aa-fe2a3aeacd01%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb979%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223050%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223054%22%7D%5D" href="/book-a-demo" data-wf-event-ids="" class="button-primary is-small_primary w-inline-block book-a-demo"><div class="u-text-style-small margin-none u-weight-medium">Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-arrow-only-wrap u-hflex-left-center"><a data-wf-native-id-path="278ab5e1