-h3">Unlock unstructured data for AI</h3><p class="inline_size_small_p">Safely leverage your unstructured data in AI development while preventing data leaks and ensuring regulatory compliance through industry-leading data redaction and synthesis.</p></div><div data-padding-bottom="1.5" data-padding-top="1.5" class="button_wrap u-hflex-left-center u-gap-gutter u-hflex-wrap"><div data-padding-top="" class="button-primary-wrapper"><a data-wf-native-id-path="278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96a:278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb981:481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223054:481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223051" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223051" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96a%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c3da83e4-b293-2fc5-e0aa-fe2a3aeacd01%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb981%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223050%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223054%22%7D%5D" href="https://textual.tonic.ai/signup](https://textual.tonic.ai/signup" data-wf-event-ids="" class="button-primary is-small_primary w-inline-block  "><div class="u-text-style-small margin-none u-weight-medium">Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-arrow-only-wrap u-hflex-left-center"><a data-wf-native-id-path="278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96a:278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb981:c3da83e4-b293-2fc5-e0aa-fe2a3aeacd0e:eeb9cfa7-689f-acf6-04e5-9d96416b33b4" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="eeb9cfa7-689f-acf6-04e5-9d96416b33b4" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96a%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c3da83e4-b293-2fc5-e0aa-fe2a3aeacd01%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb981%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22eeb9cfa7-689f-acf6-04e5-9d96416b33b3%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22c3da83e4-b293-2fc5-e0aa-fe2a3aeacd0e%22%7D%5D" href="/products/textual" data-wf-event-ids="" class="button-right-arrow button-icon w-inline-block"><div class="u-text-style-small u-text-style-button u-weight-medium u-text-wrap-none">Explore Tonic Textual</div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/6646228446fcc0c0fb011d94_arrow-right-black.svg" alt="" class="button-primary-arrow"/></a></div></div><div class="w-dyn-list u-top-auto"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="card is-padding_sm is-grey_bg"><div class="u-hflex-left-center u-gap-sm u-gap-gutter"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/691f702710e169fcd1a5eb1d_wellthy-icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="logo is-max_3-5"/><div class="u-vflex-left-center"><div class="w-embed"><p class="u-text-style-tiny margin-none"><span class="u-weight-bold">Wellthy</span><span class="text-quaternary"> uses Tonic Textual to unblock AI initiatives and reduce workflow inefficiencies by 50%.</span></p></div><a href="/case-study/ai-roadblock-breakthrough-wellthy-transformed-healthcare-with-tonic" aria-label="" data-wf-native-id-path="278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96a:278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb981:c3da83e4-b293-2fc5-e0aa-fe2a3aeacd16_instance-0:c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b_instance-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3d49%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226825fec51ab3929cebd76fa1%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96a%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c3da83e4-b293-2fc5-e0aa-fe2a3aeacd01%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb981%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22c3da83e4-b293-2fc5-e0aa-fe2a3aeacd16%22%7D%5D" class="underline-button w-button u-text-style-tiny u-weight-medium">Read their case study</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-c3da83e4-b293-2fc5-e0aa-fe2a3aeacd17-3aeacd01" class="pane_image_wrap u-vflex-right-bottom"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691f6cf2e985ff5846cf7238_textual.png" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691f6cf2e985ff5846cf7238_textual-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691f6cf2e985ff5846cf7238_textual-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691f6cf2e985ff5846cf7238_textual.png 840w" class="product_stack_image is-btm_right"/></div></div></div><div class="u-embed-css w-embed"><style>
@media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
/* This creates the scroll runway for the animation */
  .products_scroll_wrapper {
    height: 190svh; /* tweak: 260–380vh depending on how long you want it */
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Pin the visible stack area */
  .products_scroll_container {
    position: sticky;
    top: 10svh;
    height: 70svh; /* pinned viewport area */
    min-height: 60rem;
  }

  /* Your existing cards */
  .product_scroll_card {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    will-change: transform;
  }
}
  .products_stack {
    min-height: 40.5rem;
  }
.product_stack_card {
	container-type: inline-size;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {
	.products_scroll_wrapper {
    height: 140svh; /* tweak: 260–380vh depending on how long you want it */
}
  .products_scroll_container {
    height: 50svh; 
    min-height: 55rem;
  }
  .products_stack {
    min-height: 34.5rem;
  }
}
@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
	.products_scroll_wrapper {
    height: auto; /* tweak: 260–380vh depending on how long you want it */
}
  .products_scroll_container {
    height: auto; 
    min-height: auto;
  }
  .products_stack {
    min-height: auto;
  }
}
</style></div><div class="u-embed-js w-embed w-script"><script>
pageFunctions.addFunction('productsScrollStackSticky', function () {
  const wrapper = document.querySelector('.products_scroll_wrapper');
  const container = document.querySelector('.products_scroll_container');
  const cards = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.product_scroll_card'));
  if (!wrapper || !container || cards.length < 3) return;

  // Only run on desktop/tablet (>= 768px)
  const MQ = window.matchMedia('(min-width: 768px)');

  // CONFIG
  const FIRST_CARD_OFFSET_REM = 5;
  const OFFSCREEN_PCT = 150; // cards 2/3 start 150% down
  const EASE = (t) => t * t * (3 - 2 * t); // smoothstep

  const clamp = (v, min, max) => Math.max(min, Math.min(max, v));

  let isActive = false;

  function applyTransforms(p) {
    // p: 0..3 (3 segments)
    // Segment 0..1: card0 5rem -> 0
    {
      const t = clamp(p / 1, 0, 1);
      const eased = EASE(t);
      const yRem = (1 - eased) * FIRST_CARD_OFFSET_REM;
      cards[0].style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${yRem}rem, 0)`;
    }
    // Segment 1..2: card1 OFFSCREEN -> 0
    {
      const t = clamp((p - 1) / 1, 0, 1);
      const eased = EASE(t);
      const yPct = (1 - eased) * OFFSCREEN_PCT;
      cards[1].style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${yPct}%, 0)`;
    }
    // Segment 2..3: card2 OFFSCREEN -> 0
    {
      const t = clamp((p - 2) / 1, 0, 1);
      const eased = EASE(t);
      const yPct = (1 - eased) * OFFSCREEN_PCT;
      cards[2].style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${yPct}%, 0)`;
    }
  }

  function setInitial() {
    cards[0].style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${FIRST_CARD_OFFSET_REM}rem, 0)`;
    cards[1].style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${OFFSCREEN_PCT}%, 0)`;
    cards[2].style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${OFFSCREEN_PCT}%, 0)`;
  }

  function clearInlineTransforms() {
    cards.forEach((c) => c.style.removeProperty('transform'));
  }

  function update() {
    if (!isActive) return;

    const rect = wrapper.getBoundingClientRect();

    // total scroll runway = wrapper height - pinned container height
    const runway = Math.max(1, wrapper.offsetHeight - container.offsetHeight);

    // scrolled into wrapper (0..runway)
    const scrolledInto = clamp(-rect.top, 0, runway);

    // ratio 0..1 => progress 0..3
    const p = (scrolledInto / runway) * 3;

    applyTransforms(p);
  }

  function enable() {
    if (isActive) return;
    isActive = true;

    setInitial();
    update();

    window.addEventListener('scroll', update, { passive: true });
    window.addEventListener('resize', update);
  }

  function disable() {
    if (!isActive) return;
    isActive = false;

    window.removeEventListener('scroll', update);
    window.removeEventListener('resize', update);

    // Important: remove transforms so mobile layout behaves normally
    clearInlineTransforms();
  }

  // Initial
  if (MQ.matches) enable();
  else disable();

  // Listen for breakpoint changes
  const onMQChange = (e) => {
    if (e.matches) enable();
    else disable();
  };

  // Safari support (older uses addListener)
  if (MQ.addEventListener) MQ.addEventListener('change', onMQChange);
  else MQ.addListener(onMQChange);
});
</script></div></div><div class="product_scroll_cta u-width-full"><div class="card is-side_padding_lg u-position-relative background---dark-black u-radius-small u-overflow-clip"><div class="u-hflex-right-center u-hflex-wrap-mobile u-gap-2xl u-position-relative"><div class="u-hflex-left-center u-hflex-wrap u-gap-2xl"><div class="grid-offset_right"><div class="hide-mobile"></div><div class="u-vflex-right-center"><h3 class="u-text-style-h3 u-text-align-right">Find the product and plan that works for you.</h3></div></div></div><div class="button-primary-wrapper"><a data-wf-native-id-path="278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96a:278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb992:8c8b21dd-3679-309a-9c63-e65fdcd3b214" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="8c8b21dd-3679-309a-9c63-e65fdcd3b214" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb96a%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%228c8b21dd-3679-309a-9c63-e65fdcd3b212%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22278ab5e1-dc74-33cb-ebe0-9dfcd1ecb992%22%7D%5D" href="/pricing" data-wf-event-ids="" class="button-primary button-icon w-inline-block book-a-demo"><div class="u-text-style-main u-text-style-button">View pricing</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/65118d0a16a9f9b2855e3a40_arrow-up-right.svg" loading="lazy" alt="An arrow pointing up and right" class="button-primary-arrow"/></a></div></div><div class="cta_gradient_overlay u-cover-absolute u-zindex-1"></div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691cc5c0ede593acb358f77a_cta-lines.avif" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691cc5c0ede593acb358f77a_cta-lines-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691cc5c0ede593acb358f77a_cta-lines-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691cc5