</svg></div><h3 class="u-text-style-medium u-weight-bold text---white">Government</h3></div><div class="industry_nav_content u-vflex-left-top"><h4 data-padding-top="x-small" class="u-text-style-large u-mb-none u-weight-regular">Modernize workflows at public agencies</h4><p class="u-text-style-small u-mb-none u-text-wrap-balance">Automate data redaction and accelerate document declassification to streamline FOIA requests and inter-agency collaboration while ensuring data security, oversight, and accuracy.</p><div data-padding-top="x-small" class="button-primary-wrapper"><a data-wf-native-id-path="c1ed6568-5d8b-141a-4376-c865d85a03c0:c1ed6568-5d8b-141a-4376-c865d85a03eb:481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223051" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223051" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c1ed6568-5d8b-141a-4376-c865d85a03c1%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22c1ed6568-5d8b-141a-4376-c865d85a03c0%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22481b31da-8fd2-456a-f42b-7296f4223050%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22c1ed6568-5d8b-141a-4376-c865d85a03eb%22%7D%5D" href="/capabilities/government-redaction" data-wf-event-ids="" class="button-primary is-small_primary w-inline-block  "><div class="u-text-style-small margin-none u-weight-medium">Learn how</div></a></div></div></button></div></div><div class="industry_media u-position-relative"><div data-poster-url="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39%2F69091bb5edfe8dc9026af898_healthcare-480p_poster.0000000.jpg" data-video-urls="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39%2F69091bb5edfe8dc9026af898_healthcare-480p_mp4.mp4,https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39%2F69091bb5edfe8dc9026af898_healthcare-480p_webm.webm" data-autoplay="true" data-loop="true" data-wf-ignore="true" id="healthcare-vid" class="industry_bg_video u-cover-absolute w-background-video w-background-video-atom"><video id="c1ed6568-5d8b-141a-4376-c865d85a03ee-