azy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691f88d258686e57206b32c2_5stars.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/></div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/6815165ac33e4c176dec9129_Redacted%20case%20study%20logo.avif" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/><div data-padding-top="1.5" class="u-vflex-left-center"><div class="u-text-style-small">“Tonic Textual unblocked all of our AI initiatives. We’ve been able to build the infrastructure that will power them all, abstracting the Textual SDK and creating a wrapper that integrates well with our systems. So now we have a button that we can press to activate data privacy, allowing us to move forward with AI. It is quite transformative.”</div></div><div data-padding-top="main" class="u-hflex-between-bottom u-overflow-clip u-width-full"><div class="u-vflex-left-bottom"><div class="u-text-style-small margin-none u-weight-medium">[NAME_GIVEN] [NAME_FAMILY]</div><div class="u-text-style-tiny margin-none">[OCCUPATION]</div></div><div class="button_wrap"><a href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/tax-agency-unblocked-ai-llm-workflows-with-secure-data-synthesis" aria-label="" data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf_instance-0:c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b_instance-0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2268150dc3aa3fbda9d872c41a%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf%22%7D%5D" class="underline-button w-button">Read review</a></div></div></div><div class="active_cs_outline is-reviews_outline u-radius-small u-cover-absolute"></div></div><div role="listitem" class="review_item w-dyn-item u-position-relative"><a data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8da2_instance-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8da2" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2267c5c795a35af99401e906e6%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%5D" href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/faster-testing-more-releases-fewer-bugs-and-bigger-deals-for-hone-with-tonic" target="_blank" class="resource_link u-position-absolute w-inline-block"></a><div class="card is-white is-marquee_review u-zindex-2 u-vflex-left-between u-height-full u-width-full"><div class="u-hflex-left-center w-condition-invisible u-gap-gutter"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem w-dyn-bind-empty"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691f88d258686e57206b32c2_5stars.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/></div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/645944cb47224af5a8ca764a_Hone%20logo.avif" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/><div data-padding-top="1.5" class="u-vflex-left-center"><div class="u-text-style-small">“Before we had Tonic and the availability of production-quality data for our engineers and QA, we would see critical issues at least once a week that were tied to not being able to accurately test our features under real-world scenarios. Now, we haven&#x27;t had a critical issue since we fully operationalized Tonic into our software development life cycle. That was nine months ago.&quot;</div></div><div data-padding-top="main" class="u-hflex-between-bottom u-overflow-clip u-width-full"><div class="u-vflex-left-bottom"><div class="u-text-style-small margin-none u-weight-medium">Jason Lock</div><div class="u-text-style-tiny margin-none">Senior Software Engineer and Tech Lead</div></div><div class="button_wrap"><a href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/faster-testing-more-releases-fewer-bugs-and-bigger-deals-for-hone-with-tonic" aria-label="" data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf_instance-1:c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b_instance-1" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2267c5c795a35af99401e906e6%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf%22%7D%5D" class="underline-button w-button">Read review</a></div></div></div><div class="active_cs_outline is-reviews_outline u-radius-small u-cover-absolute"></div></div><div role="listitem" class="review_item w-dyn-item u-position-relative"><a data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8da2_instance-2" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8da2" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226908d31c28d385253f86f191%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%5D" href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/how-alegeus-shortens-sprints-to-deploy-healthtech-at-speed-with-tonic" target="_blank" class="resource_link u-position-absolute w-inline-block"></a><div class="card is-white is-marquee_review u-zindex-2 u-vflex-left-between u-height-full u-width-full"><div class="u-hflex-left-center w-condition-invisible u-gap-gutter"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem w-dyn-bind-empty"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691f88d258686e57206b32c2_5stars.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/></div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/63d03b9f300e4c9604629e64_62e28cf08913e83153ba2c56_604d40693fdf20831725173b_alegeus.avif" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/><div data-padding-top="1.5" class="u-vflex-left-center"><div class="u-text-style-small">&quot;With Tonic, you get all the benefits of a smart, hungry startup—being super flexible, working hand-in-hand, iterating quickly to deploy new features—without any of the drawbacks some people fear. They have a superstar engineering team, willing to engage on every level with a white-glove approach. I can’t say enough good things about them.&quot;</div></div><div data-padding-top="main" class="u-hflex-between-bottom u-overflow-clip u-width-full"><div class="u-vflex-left-bottom"><div class="u-text-style-small margin-none u-weight-medium">Nemo Nemeth</div><div class="u-text-style-tiny margin-none">Head of Data Products</div></div><div class="button_wrap"><a href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/how-alegeus-shortens-sprints-to-deploy-healthtech-at-speed-with-tonic" aria-label="" data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf_instance-2:c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b_instance-2" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b" data-wf-cms-context="%5B