_5e4c4dd910317969b7e63e4aa862c4a169b215bf.avif" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/63d03b9ee78b8a00bca202c9_62e28cf08913e84fdeba2ceb_62a8db6130e75fa9b9842836_5e4c4dd910317969b7e63e4aa862c4a169b215bf-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/63d03b9ee78b8a00bca202c9_62e28cf08913e84fdeba2ceb_62a8db6130e75fa9b9842836_5e4c4dd910317969b7e63e4aa862c4a169b215bf-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/63d03b9ee78b8a00bca202c9_62e28cf08913e84fdeba2ceb_62a8db6130e75fa9b9842836_5e4c4dd910317969b7e63e4aa862c4a169b215bf-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/63d03b9ee78b8a00bca202c9_62e28cf08913e84fdeba2ceb_62a8db6130e75fa9b9842836_5e4c4dd910317969b7e63e4aa862c4a169b215bf-p-1600.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/63d03b9ee78b8a00bca202c9_62e28cf08913e84fdeba2ceb_62a8db6130e75fa9b9842836_5e4c4dd910317969b7e63e4aa862c4a169b215bf.avif 5000w" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/><div data-padding-top="1.5" class="u-vflex-left-center"><div class="u-text-style-small">&quot;The faster lead time that we have with QA, the more things we can test in a day, the faster we can release and at higher quality than before.&quot;</div></div><div data-padding-top="main" class="u-hflex-between-bottom u-overflow-clip u-width-full"><div class="u-vflex-left-bottom"><div class="u-text-style-small margin-none u-weight-medium">Felipe Talavera</div><div class="u-text-style-tiny margin-none">Engineering Fellow</div></div><div class="button_wrap"><a href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/flywire-reduces-environment-testing-time-with-tonic" aria-label="" data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf_instance-3:c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b_instance-3" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226734b559b841aa4a470d242a%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf%22%7D%5D" class="underline-button w-button">Read review</a></div></div></div><div class="active_cs_outline is-reviews_outline u-radius-small u-cover-absolute"></div></div><div role="listitem" class="review_item w-dyn-item u-position-relative"><a data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8da2_instance-4" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8da2" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2267c5c915eca4d084e9e8387f%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%5D" href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/everlywell-gains-5x-deployment-velocity-with-support-from-tonic" target="_blank" class="resource_link u-position-absolute w-inline-block"></a><div class="card is-white is-marquee_review u-zindex-2 u-vflex-left-between u-height-full u-width-full"><div class="u-hflex-left-center w-condition-invisible u-gap-gutter"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem w-dyn-bind-empty"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691f88d258686e57206b32c2_5stars.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/></div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/63d03b9d70079f5de2dd7607_62e28cf08913e84ff6ba2c5f_6053df7b63f30f5dbdd92eee_everlywell.png" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/><div data-padding-top="1.5" class="u-vflex-left-center"><div class="u-text-style-small">“With Tonic, we’ve shortened our build process from 60 minutes down to 20. Their subsetting and de-identification tools are a critical part of Everlywell’s development cycle, making it easy for us to get data down to a useful size and giving me confidence it’s protected throughout.”</div></div><div data-padding-top="main" class="u-hflex-between-bottom u-overflow-clip u-width-full"><div class="u-vflex-left-bottom"><div class="u-text-style-small margin-none u-weight-medium">Sebastian Kowalczyk</div><div class="u-text-style-tiny margin-none">Senior DevOps Engineer</div></div><div class="button_wrap"><a href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/everlywell-gains-5x-deployment-velocity-with-support-from-tonic" aria-label="" data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf_instance-4:c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b_instance-4" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2267c5c915eca4d084e9e8387f%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf%22%7D%5D" class="underline-button w-button">Read review</a></div></div></div><div class="active_cs_outline is-reviews_outline u-radius-small u-cover-absolute"></div></div><div role="listitem" class="review_item w-dyn-item u-position-relative"><a data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8da2_instance-5" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8da2" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2267c5c871259f701992ad6047%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%5D" href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/accelerating-training-and-onboarding-at-pax8-with-realistic-demo-data-from-tonic" target="_blank" class="resource_link u-position-absolute w-inline-block"></a><div class="card is-white is-marquee_review u-zindex-2 u-vflex-left-between u-height-full u-width-full"><div class="u-hflex-left-center w-condition-invisible u-gap-gutter"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem w-dyn-bind-empty"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691f88d258686e57206b32c2_5stars.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/></div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/64aef5b3ffa73b5aa86a6a62_pax8-logo-dark-ink.avif" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/64aef5b3ffa73b5aa86a6a62_pax8-logo-dark-ink-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/64aef5b3ffa73b5aa86a6a62_pax8-logo-dark-ink.avif 1758w" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/><div data-padding-top="1.5" class="u-vflex-left-center"><div class="u-text-style-small">“You can’t tell that our demo environment runs on Tonic data. It is so close to a mirrored experience for what our partners deal with, and that helps us empower them and guide them better. End of story.”</div></div><div data-padding-top="main" class="u-hflex-between-bottom u-overflow-clip u-width-full"><div class="u-vflex-left-bottom"><div class="u-text-style-small margin-none u-weight-medium">Matty Woznick</div><div class="u-text-style-tiny margin-none">Enablement Programs Manager</div></div><div class="button_wrap"><a href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/accelerating-training-and-onboarding-at-pax8-with-realistic-demo-data-from-tonic" aria-label="" data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf_instance-5:c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b_instance-5" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2267c5c871259f701992ad6047%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf%22%7D%5D" class="underline-button w-button">Read review</a></div></div></div><div class="active_cs_outline is-reviews_outline u-radius-small u-cover-absolute"></div></div><div role="listitem" class="review_item w-dyn-item u-position-relative"><a data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8da2_instance-6" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8da2" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e4241%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%5D" href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/kin-insurance-accelerates-growth-with-faster-more-secure-data-access-courtesy-of-tonic" target="_blank" class="resource_link u-position-absolute w-inline-block"></a><div class="card is-white is-marquee_review u-zindex-2 u-vflex-left-between u-height-full u-width-full"><div class="u-hflex-left-center w-condition-invisible u-gap-gutter"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem w-dyn-bind-empty"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691f88d258686e57206b32c2_5stars.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/></div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/63d03b9e24e3a2dde2ca6055_62e28cf08913e8f01dba2d28_604da1342bdd8634f116464d_kin-1.avif" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/><div data-padding-top="1.5" class="u-vflex-left-center"><div class="u-text-style-small">&quot;We are very much a ‘Let’s deploy as quickly as possible’ company. Accessing data took so long that developers didn’t want to do it. Tonic changed that out of the gate. We used to have to load tables overnight sometimes. Now Tonic can kick off a database that anyone can pull down in an hour or less.&quot;</div></div><div data-padding-top="main" class="u-hflex-between-bottom u-overflow-clip u-width-full"><div class="u-vflex-left-bottom"><div class="u-text-style-small margin-none u-weight-medium">Stephen Wooten</div><div class="u-text-style-tiny margin-none">Co-Founder &amp; Director of Engineering</div></div><div class="button_wrap"><a href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/kin-insurance-accelerates-growth-with-faster-more-secure-data-access-courtesy-of-tonic" aria-label="" data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf_instance-6:c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b_instance-6" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e4241%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf%22%7D%5D" class="underline-button w-button">Read review</a></div></div></div><div class="active_cs_outline is-reviews_outline u-radius-small u-cover-absolute"></div></div><div role="listitem" class="review_item w-dyn-item u-position-relative"><a data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8da2_instance-7" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8da2" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e4246%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%5D" href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/getting-ebay-developers-the-data-theyre-looking-for-with-tonic" target="_blank" class="resource_link u-position-absolute w-inline-block"></a><div class="card is-white is-marquee_review u-zindex-2 u-vflex-left-between u-height-full u-width-full"><div class="u-hflex-left-center w-condition-invisible u-gap-gutter"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem w-dyn-bind-empty"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e81176ba2c39/691f88d258686e57206b32c2_5stars.svg" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/></div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62e28cf08913e80aefba2c44/63d03b9d24e3a26d95ca604b_62e28cf08913e82575ba2c63_6053e66b9030097706b09f7f_ebay.avif" alt="" class="logo is-max_height is-2rem"/><div data-padding-top="1.5" class="u-vflex-left-center"><div class="u-text-style-small">“Tonic has an intuitive, powerful platform for generating realistic, safe data for development and testing. Tonic has helped eBay streamline the very challenging problem of representing the complexities contained within Petabytes of data distributed across many environments.”</div></div><div data-padding-top="main" class="u-hflex-between-bottom u-overflow-clip u-width-full"><div class="u-vflex-left-bottom"><div class="u-text-style-small margin-none u-weight-medium">Senthil Padmanabhan</div><div class="u-text-style-tiny margin-none">VP of Engineering</div></div><div class="button_wrap"><a href="https://www.tonic.ai/case-study/getting-ebay-developers-the-data-theyre-looking-for-with-tonic" aria-label="" data-wf-native-id-path="318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81:318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf_instance-7:c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b_instance-7" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e3df9%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2264beea08e8bd5cee590e4246%22%7D%5D" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d82%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8d81%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22c3a0ee47-85f2-8410-3ea0-5b3d476c853b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22318937f0-ae3d-0d73-ff2e-91d0fabf8daf%22%7D%5D" class="underline-button w-button">Read review</a></div></div></div><div class="active_cs_outline is-reviews_outline u-radius-small u-cover-absolute"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="u-embed-css w-embed"><style>
/* --- Scoped default states (only apply to elements inside .case_study_item) --- */
.review_item .active_cs_outline {
  transform: translateY(0);
  transition: transform 0.25s ease;
  will-change: transform;
  opacity: 0%;
  outline: none;
}

.review_item .button_wrap {
  opacity: 0;
  visibility: hidden;
  transform: translateY(0.5rem);       /* small starting offset if you want */
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  will-change: opacity, transform;
  pointer-events: none;                /* prevents accidental interaction while hidden */
}

/* move text down initially (only inside cards) */
.review_item .u-text-style-large {
  transform: translateY(1.5rem);
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  will-change: transform;
}

/* --- Hover states (only when hovering the .case_study_item itself) --- */
.review_item:hover .active_cs_outline {
  transform: translateY(2px);
  opacity: 100%;
}

/* Fade in and show the button when hovering the parent .case_study_item */
.review_item:hover .button_wrap {
  opacity: 1;
  visibility: visible;
  transform: translateY(0);
  pointer-events: auto;  /* re-enable interaction when visible */
}

/* Move the text into place when hovering parent */
.review_item:hover .u-text-style-large {
  transform: translateY(0);
}
</style></div><div class="u-embed-css w-embed"><style>
/* Ensure the mover element is wide enough to contain BOTH lists */
.reviews_mover_left,
.reviews_mover_right {
    display: flex; /* Already set, but good for safety */
    /* This width setting is key: it tells the browser the total space it needs */
    width: 200vw; /* Use a very large, non-specific width to ensure enough space. 
                     Alternatively, set width to 200% in Webflow on this element. */
}

/* --- Left-Moving Marquee (Animation moves right-to-left) --- */

@keyframes move-left {
    /* We use calc() to ensure the loop point is slightly nudged */
    from {
        transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0); 
    }
    to {
        /* Move exactly -50% of the total element width */
        transform: translate3d(-50%, 0, 0);
    }
}

.reviews_mover_left {
    animation: move-left 60s linear infinite; 
}


/* --- Right-Moving Marquee (Animation moves left-to-right) --- */

@keyframes move-right {
    from {
        /* Start from -50% and use calc() for slight nudging */
        transform: translate3d(calc(-50% - 1px), 0, 0); 
    }
    to {
        /* Move exactly back to 0 */
        transform: translate3d(0%, 0, 0);
    }
}

.reviews_mover_right {
    animation: move-right 60s linear infinite; 
}
/* --- Hover Pause Functionality --- */

.reviews_mover_left:hover,
.reviews_mover_right:hover {
    animation-play-state: paused;
}
</style></div></div></section><section class="resources_wrapper"><div data-padding-bottom="small" data-padding-top="large" class="resources_container u-container u-overflow-clip"><div class="u-grid-column-2"><div class="u-vflex-left-top"><h2 class="u-text-style-h2">Data synthesis guides</h2><p class="u-text-style-main text-quaternary u-text-wrap-balance">Explore the world of data synthesis and discover how it plays a crucial role in safeguarding sensitive information while maintaining data utility in software and AI development.</p></div></div><div data-delay="4000" data-animation="slide" class="resource_slider w-slider u-width-full" data-autoplay="false" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-disable-swipe="false" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-nav-spacing="3" data-duration="350" data-infinite="true" fs-cmsslider-element="slider"><div class="resource_slider_mask w-slider-mask u-overflow-visible u-hflex-left-stretch u-gap-none"><div class="resource_slide w-slide u-align-self-stretch u-width-full"></div></div><div class="slider_btn is-left w-slider-arrow-left u-radius-round u-vflex-center-center"><div class="u-vflex-left-center w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
